      "rank_turnover": 0.0627609767,
      "decay_ic_5d": 0.0161893768,
      "decay_ic_10d": 0.0304481704,
      "decay_ic_20d": 0.0542403909,
      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "regime_notes": "Validated across 15 tradable cross-asset benchmark instruments and multiple regimes. Small cross-section implies conservative uncertainty; broad date coverage supports stability. Raw trend-quality orientation was negative at all tested horizons, so the persisted factor uses its interpretable reversal orientation.",
    "signal_artifact": "scripts/miner_1_20351108_breadth_conditioned_trend_quality.py"
